  riddles:
  - question: I belong entirely to you, and nobody else has the right to change me.
      Yet, everyone you meet will use me far more often than you ever do yourself,
    correctAnswer: Your Name
    slightwrongAnswer: Your face
    dumbAnswer: Your phone Number
  - question: I possess a single eye, yet I am entirely blind. I drag a long tail
      behind me wherever I go, cutting a clean path through cloth, yet I cause no
      pain. What am I?
    correctAnswer: a Needle
    slightwrongAnswer: a fishHook
    dumbAnswer: a Sword
  - question: I am born in a single silent instant, yet I can outlive empires. I
      have no physical weight, but keeping me locked away can crush the strongest
      mind. The more of me you hold, the heavier the burden feels, but giving me
      away to the right person sets you free. What am I?
    correctAnswer: a secret
    slightwrongAnswer: guilt
    dumbAnswer: Memories
  doorOutcomes: 000000000100000002000000
